-- Six warriors; some carry the TwoHanded component and some lack it, with junk behind the missing cells. A component you don't have is not a zero — presence is its own question, and (Nord, ...) asks it three ways: has it above 60, has it at all, lacks it.
--! registry ../registries/006-presence-patterns.reg
--! expect gold = 1000 0 0 0 1000 0
--! expect trained = 1 1 0 0 1 0
--! expect untrained = 0 0 1 0 0 1

(Nord, TwoHanded > 60) , Gold += 1000
(Nord, TwoHanded _) , +Trained
(Nord, !TwoHanded) , +Untrained
